*** Epi Info AI MATCH zero-discordant-cell boundary exercise
*** Dataset: case-control-database-example.xlsx (130 records; 65 matched pairs)
*** School has b=16 and c=0 across 29 complete pairs, so the matched OR is +infinity.
*** Another 36 pairs are excluded because School is missing for one or both members.

FREQ school

TABLES school caco

MATCH school caco MATCHVAR=matched_pairs
